# Leovold, Emissary of Trest has no haste of its own. Goryo's Vengeance returns it from the graveyard on turn 1 and it gains haste
# (printed haste, as Headliner Scarlett has, would hide the effect): it attacks the turn it arrives, for 3, and is exiled at the
# beginning of the end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Entomb
Goryo's Vengeance
Island x3
Leovold, Emissary of Trest
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

